The optional Danish Speech Model ekko-v1-tiny by RyeAI, from
https://huggingface.co/RyeAI/ekko-v1-tiny at revision
3658535e7b2fa98d5d9aad8114573c0fab1e6203, is downloaded unchanged (the q5_0
