The ekko Speech Model runs on parakeet.cpp v0.6.1, Copyright (c) 2026 the
parakeet.cpp authors, under the MIT License, with its own copy of ggml,
Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors, MIT License. Both licenses are
